  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1.0 adds Native AOT and trimming compatibility to Banned.Bangumi.\n\n\t\t\t- Added source-generated System.Text.Json metadata for every API request and response type.\n\t\t\t- Added Native AOT and trimming compatibility without changing the public API.\n\t\t\t- Added a self-contained Native AOT smoke application covering request serialization and response deserialization.\n\t\t\t- Added continuous integration checks for multi-target builds, unit tests, and linux-x64 Native AOT publishing.",
